{
  "provider": "STUBA",
  "providerHotelId": "65875",
  "name": "Ramada Plaza by Wyndham Istanbul City Center",
  "starRating": 5,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Information about the surrounding area",
      "text": "With a stay at Ramada Plaza by Wyndham Istanbul City Center Adults Only, you\u0027ll be centrally located in Istanbul, within a 5-minute drive of Taksim Square and Galata Tower.  This luxury hotel is 3.2 mi (5.2 km) from Bosphorus Bridge and 3.8 mi (6.1 km) from Grand Bazaar."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Details of room types available",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 179 air-conditioned rooms featuring minibars and Smart televisions. Complimentary wired and wireless internet access keeps you connected, and satellite programming provides entertainment. Private bathrooms with showers feature complimentary toiletries and hair dryers. Conveniences include phones, as well as laptop-compatible safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Information about the hotel property",
      "text": "Pamper yourself with onsite massages and body treatments. You\u0027re sure to appreciate the recreational amenities, including an outdoor pool, a sauna, and a fitness center. Additional features at this hotel include complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and shopping on site. Guests can catch a ride to nearby destinations on the area shuttle (surcharge)."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Activities available near the hotel",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003ELutfi Kirdar Convention and Exhibition Centre - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Congress Center - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E American Hospital - 0.9 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Acibadem Taksim Hospital - 1.2 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Taksim Square - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Cevahir Shopping and Entertainment Centre - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Vodafone Park - 2 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istiklal Avenue - 2 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Hastanesi Memorial Hospital - 2.3 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Dolmabah\u00E7e Palace - 2.3 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Trump Towers Istanbul - 2.3 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Bosphorus - 2.3 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Sisli Florence Nightingale Hospital - 2.4 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Mecidiyekoy Square - 2.5 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Besiktas Pier - 2.6 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EIstanbul Airport (IST) - 39.1 km / 24.3 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Sabiha Gokcen Intl. Airport (SAW) - 41.1 km / 25.6 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Ramada Plaza by Wyndham Istanbul City Center Adults Only is Istanbul Airport (IST). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Hotel policies and disclaimer",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards; cash is not accepted\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless transactions are available\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property affirms that it follows the cleaning and disinfection practices of Count on Us (Wyndham)\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EReservations are required for massage services and spa treatments. Reservations can be made by contacting the hotel prior to arrival, using the contact information on the booking confirmation. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuests under 12 years old are not permitted at this adults-only property. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe property has connecting/adjoining rooms, which are subject to availability and can be requested by contacting the property using the number on the booking confirmation. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENo pets and no service animals are allowed at this property. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless payment methods are available for all transactions.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EContactless check-in is available.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Meals and restaurants at the hotel",
      "text": "For lunch or dinner, stop by Pancaldi, a restaurant that specializes in Turkish cuisine. Dining is also available at the coffee shop/cafe, and 24-hour room service is provided. Wrap up your day with a drink at the bar/lounge. Buffet breakfasts are available daily from 7:00 AM to 11:00 AM for a fee."
    },
    {
